>> a := Ntho ncha.
>> b := Ntho ncha.
>> c := a.
Sephetho ngola: a aterese-ea-mohopolo litlhaku ? 0, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: a aterese-ea-mohopolo litlhaku ? 1, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: a aterese-ea-mohopolo = b aterese-ea-mohopolo, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: a aterese-ea-mohopolo = c aterese-ea-mohopolo, mola-o-mocha.
